## 响应参数

**错误码为200时：**

|参数|参数类型|描述|
|:-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|:-------|
|详见HwWalletObject[参数描述](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/param-0000001050158366)|[HwWalletObject](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/def-0000001050160319)|已添加的卡券模板|

